<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="out-of-the-box"><p class="ch__num">01 · Start</p><h2>Out of the box</h2><p class="ch__lead">Everything for the first session is in the box, except the hookah, your tobacco and a USB-C wall charger. Here is what each part is and what it is for.</p><div class="boxgrid boxgrid--stack"><div class="box__img"><figure class="bx bx--hero" data-tile="0" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Diamond with thermo cap">{%- if section.settings.img_device_top != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_device_top | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_device_top.alt | default: 'Diamond with thermo cap', width: section.settings.img_device_top.width, height: section.settings.img_device_top.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-device-top.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Diamond with thermo cap" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Diamond with thermo cap</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Ceramic cups">{%- if section.settings.img_cup != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_cup | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_cup.alt | default: 'Ceramic cups', width: section.settings.img_cup.width, height: section.settings.img_cup.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-cup.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Ceramic cups" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<i class="bx__n">×2</i><figcaption class="bx__t">Ceramic cups</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="2" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Basket mesh">{%- if section.settings.img_basket != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_basket | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_basket.alt | default: 'Basket mesh', width: section.settings.img_basket.width, height: section.settings.img_basket.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-basket.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Basket mesh" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Basket mesh</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Flat mesh screens">{%- if section.settings.img_screens != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_screens | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_screens.alt | default: 'Flat mesh screens', width: section.settings.img_screens.width, height: section.settings.img_screens.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-screens-2.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Flat mesh screens" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<i class="bx__n">×3</i><figcaption class="bx__t">Flat mesh screens</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Long adapter">{%- if section.settings.img_adapter_tall != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_adapter_tall | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_adapter_tall.alt | default: 'Long adapter', width: section.settings.img_adapter_tall.width, height: section.settings.img_adapter_tall.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-adapter-tall.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Long adapter" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Long adapter</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="5" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Short adapter">{%- if section.settings.img_adapter_short != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_adapter_short | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_adapter_short.alt | default: 'Short adapter', width: section.settings.img_adapter_short.width, height: section.settings.img_adapter_short.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-adapter-short.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Short adapter" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Short adapter</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="6" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Cup removal tool">{%- if section.settings.img_tool != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_tool | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_tool.alt | default: 'Cup removal tool', width: section.settings.img_tool.width, height: section.settings.img_tool.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-tool.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Cup removal tool" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Cup removal tool</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx bx--s" data-tile="7" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Cleaning brush">{%- if section.settings.img_brush != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_brush | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_brush.alt | default: 'Cleaning brush', width: section.settings.img_brush.width, height: section.settings.img_brush.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-brush.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Cleaning brush" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">Cleaning brush</figcaption></figure><figure class="bx " data-tile="8" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="USB-C cable">{%- if section.settings.img_cable != blank -%}{{- section.settings.img_cable | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_cable.alt | default: 'USB-C cable', width: section.settings.img_cable.width, height: section.settings.img_cable.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-cut2-d-cable.webp' | file_url }}" alt="USB-C cable" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption class="bx__t">USB-C cable</figcaption></figure><p class="box__cap" aria-live="polite">Tap a part to see what it is</p></div><ul class="boxlist"><li data-tile="0"><em>×1</em><div><b>Diamond</b><span>With the thermo cap fitted and the battery inside.</span></div></li><li data-tile="0"><em>×1</em><div><b>Diamond Battery</b><span>Removable. Charges inside Diamond or on its own. About 90 minutes per charge.</span></div></li><li data-tile="1"><em>×2</em><div><b>Ceramic cups</b><span>The tobacco goes here: one running, one packed and waiting.</span></div></li><li data-tile="2"><em>×1</em><div><b>Basket mesh</b><span>Sits in the cup for a loose, airy pack. Lifts out in one piece to clean.</span></div></li><li data-tile="3"><em>×3</em><div><b>Flat mesh screens</b><span>Lie on the bottom of the cup for a denser pack.</span></div></li><li data-tile="6"><em>×1</em><div><b>Cup removal tool</b><span>Lifts the hot cup out, and turns the plate on the cap.</span></div></li><li data-tile="4"><em>×1</em><div><b>Long adapter</b><span>Seats Diamond on your hookah stem.</span></div></li><li data-tile="5"><em>×1</em><div><b>Short adapter</b><span>The same, for shorter stem tops. Most stems take either.</span></div></li><li data-tile="7"><em>×1</em><div><b>Cleaning brush</b><span>For the shaft and the chamber.</span></div></li><li data-tile="8"><em>×1</em><div><b>USB-C cable</b><span>Charges Diamond or the battery. The wall charger is not in the box.</span></div></li></ul></div><h3>Before you switch it on</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:5"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>The latch</b><p>Turn Diamond round. The battery sits behind the black arc latch on the back.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.latch_closed != blank -%}{{- section.settings.latch_closed | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.latch_closed.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.latch_closed.width, height: section.settings.latch_closed.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-closed.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Open the latch</b><p>Flip the latch open with a finger.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.latch_open != blank -%}{{- section.settings.latch_open | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.latch_open.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.latch_open.width, height: section.settings.latch_open.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-open.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Battery out</b><p>Lift the battery out by the latch.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.battery_out != blank -%}{{- section.settings.battery_out | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.battery_out.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.battery_out.width, height: section.settings.battery_out.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-out.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">4</span><b>Paper tab off</b><p>Pull the small paper tab off the battery contacts. With it in place Diamond will not switch on.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.pack_contacts != blank -%}{{- section.settings.pack_contacts | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.pack_contacts.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.pack_contacts.width, height: section.settings.pack_contacts.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-pack-contacts.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<span class="mk mk--warn mk--l" style="left:79.3%;top:73%"><i></i><span>Paper tab: pull it off</span></span></div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">5</span><b>Back in, latch closed</b><p>With the latch open, set the battery in, contacts down. Then close the latch so the battery is locked in place.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.latch_close != blank -%}{{- section.settings.latch_close | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.latch_close.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.latch_close.width, height: section.settings.latch_close.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-battery-latch-close.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section>
</div>

